        "{\"version\":1,\"content\":\"<h1>RUN TIMES</h1><p>\\n\\n</p><p>Measured on a <b>24 GB RTX 4090</b> with this workflow, with the models already loaded. A different card gives different numbers, but the shape holds: the time grows with the number of pictures and their size.</p><p>\\n\\n</p><hr class=\\\"pix-note-hr-solid\\\" style=\\\"color: #b8b8b8\\\"><p>\\n\\n</p><table class=\\\"pix-note-grid\\\" style=\\\"--pix-note-grid-border: #f66744; --pix-note-grid-header-bg: #1a1a1a\\\"><thead><tr><th>Steps on</th><th>Time</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>A and C (the demo), 4 pictures</td><td>about 3.5 s</td></tr><tr><td>All three, 4 pictures</td><td>about 4 s</td></tr></tbody></table><p>\\n\\n</p><p>No big model: BiRefNet is 444 MB, the other steps use none.</p><p>\\n\\n</p><hr class=\\\"pix-note-hr-solid\\\" style=\\\"color: #b8b8b8\\\"><p>\\n\\n</p><h2><span data-ic=\\\"warning-v1\\\" class=\\\"pix-note-ic\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\"></span>&nbsp;The first Run of the session</h2><p>\\n\\n</p><p>The first Run after starting ComfyUI also has to load the models from disk (about 18 GB for Klein and its text encoder), so it takes longer. After that they stay loaded.</p><p>\\n\\n</p>\",\"buttonColor\":\"#f66744\",\"lineColor\":\"#f66744\",\"backgroundColor\":\"#2a2a2a\",\"info\":{\"title\":\"Run Times\",\"icon\":\"run-timer\",\"color\":\"#3f9a4f\"}}"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
